    "original":"anena sārthakasya śabdasya dhvanirūpatvaṃ pramāṇatāmāyāti । nirarthako'pi śabdo dhvaniriti tu loke prasiddhameva । kiñca, nūtanadhvanivijñānaloke sarvavidho'pi śabdaḥ dhvanirucyate । saṃvitsvarūpā mantravīryātmā parā vāga, atha ca paśyantī, madhyameti vāktrayamapi dhvanipadena vyapadiśyate । tadyathā",
    "analyzed":"anena sārthakasya śabdasya dhvani rūpa tvam pramāṇa tām āyāti nirarthakaḥ api śabdaḥ dhvaniḥ iti tu loke prasiddham eva kiñca nūtana dhvani vijñāna loke sarvavidhaḥ api śabdaḥ dhvaniḥ ucyate saṃvid svarūpā mantra vīrya ātmā parā atha ca paśyantī madhyamā iti vāc trayam api dhvani padena vyapadiśyate tat yathā ",
